{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive hell in this Roguelike Deckbuilder that features card battles with an in-depth auto-battler-esque synergy and combo system.\u00a0Help Bobo, the little penguin, recruit allies and face the many horrors that await him on his journey to save his friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/extras/Build_your_Synergies.png?t=1747274129\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit powerful allies and create your <strong>team composition</strong> navigating an in-depth synergy system! Arrange powerful<strong> </strong>combinations to exploit and escalate your power level to cruise through the gates of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/extras/Loot_and_Itemize.png?t=1747274129\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relinquish your foes and pick up <strong>powerful items</strong> to fine-tune your <strong>composition</strong>. Carefully weigh the pros and cons of each artifact and use unique interactions to give you the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/extras/IMG_1185.png?t=1747274129\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way through the circles of hell under the guidance of our local, friendly red-hooded figure. Beware of your <strong>choices</strong>, penguin, as decision-making is the deciding factor between facing the unpleasant and the unrelenting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/extras/Features.png?t=1747274129\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bobo In Hell at release will ship with:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">165+ character cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ unique items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ action cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ synergetic archetypes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of different viable builds and combinations.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532340?t=1747274129","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/e1cb506b7542fb0dd356076eeeb2634fb47c31c9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747274129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/9cd32157810337616ab689b8cdcbe8b85e59f14d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747274129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/9cd32157810337616ab689b8cdcbe8b85e59f14d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747274129","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of violence, demons and other religious symbology."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive hell in this Roguelike Deckbuilder that features card battles with an in-depth auto-battler-esque synergy and combo system.\u00a0Help Bobo, the little penguin, recruit allies and face the many horrors that await him on his journey to save his friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/extras/Build_your_Synergies.png?t=1747274129\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit powerful allies and create your <strong>team composition</strong> navigating an in-depth synergy system! Arrange powerful<strong> </strong>combinations to exploit and escalate your power level to cruise through the gates of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/extras/Loot_and_Itemize.png?t=1747274129\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relinquish your foes and pick up <strong>powerful items</strong> to fine-tune your <strong>composition</strong>. Carefully weigh the pros and cons of each artifact and use unique interactions to give you the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/extras/IMG_1185.png?t=1747274129\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way through the circles of hell under the guidance of our local, friendly red-hooded figure. Beware of your <strong>choices</strong>, penguin, as decision-making is the deciding factor between facing the unpleasant and the unrelenting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/extras/Features.png?t=1747274129\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bobo In Hell at release will ship with:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">165+ character cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ unique items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ action cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ synergetic archetypes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of different viable builds and combinations.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Arcana Rebels"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/header.jpg?t=1747274129","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Bobo in Hell","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB Video Memory capable of OpenGL 3.0+ support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Arcana Rebels"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas l\u00edcitas\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nMedo","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol / Tabak\nGewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"November 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532340/b464de9112abac7ce71738d184c8916425e3dfec/ss_b464de9112abac7ce71738d184c8916425e3dfec.1920x1080.jpg